  "description_snippet": "**VULNERABILITY DETAILS**   \nWhen an IndexedDB transaction is created, indexed_db_connection.cc stores a map from transaction id to a unique_ptr containing the IndexedDBTransaction, and schedules some actions with the raw pointer. A compromised renderer can create a new transaction with the same id,"
